ASR intro_day: A new day, a clear head, something great to build.
ASR intro_work: Then a quick question and another.
ASR intro_inbox: 150 unread emails.
ASR intro_pings: 10 slack pings, one after another.
ASR intro_meetings: Three meetings, two of them after hours.
ASR intro_focus: Your attention is everywhere. Your work is still waiting.
ASR intro_relief: Meet A.I. Peer, a teammate who makes room for your best work.
ASR intro_create: Start with one click, Create my AI Peer.
ASR intro_profile: One Airbnb brings in your role, risk partner systems, and your projects.
ASR intro_github: GitHub connects your team's code, services, and changes already in progress.
ASR intro_airchat: Add the AI Peer plugin in AirChat. It understands your local projects, current tasks, and uncommitted changes even before you push to GitHub.
ASR intro_access: Connect Slack, Zoom, email, and your calendar.
ASR intro_ready: Your peer is ready.
ASR bobo_title: Spot the work that needs you.
ASR bobo_intro: A new product lets someone book on behalf of a guest. Payment's risk wasn't in the loop.
ASR bobo_alert: Bobo may change how we handle chargebacks. I couldn't find payments risk in the launch discussion. Here's the product owner. Worth checking before this becomes a problem.
ASR bobo_impact: A company announcement becomes an early heads up with someone to contact.
ASR slack_title: Keep collaboration going across time zones.
ASR slack_intro: Manish needs cancellation window data. The data team works in the U.S.
ASR slack_question: What do you need it for?
ASR slack_wait: It's 2 a.m. for Manish. One clarification could cost another day.
ASR slack_peer: I'm Manish's AI peer. Dispute agents need to see whether the guest cancelled inside or outside the flexibility window to help assess the chargeback.
ASR slack_reply: Got it, the purchased items expiry gives you the Windows end. I'll share an example to verify.
ASR slack_impact: an answer before the next morning.
ASR zoom_title: Be there through your peer.
ASR zoom_ask: Manish's Pier, what's the latest on premium chargebacks?
ASR zoom_update: The data contract is merged, interface and back-end changes are still drafts.
ASR zoom_source: validate with a fresh dispute case.
ASR zoom_sarah: I'll coordinate the example case.
ASR zoom_date: Can we set a date?
ASR zoom_boundary: Manish needs to review the validation before we commit.
ASR missed_title: Catch what slipped through.
ASR missed_cleanup: 150 emails marked as red, but was everything handled?
ASR missed_airversary: Yasha's 5 year anniversary is coming up, Vijay shared an appreciation board, here's his email and the link to add your message.
ASR missed_fireside: You follow AI closely. This fireside chat with Boris Chirny looks relevant. Your invitation is still unanswered. Would you like me to accept it?
ASR missed_cassette: You may have missed this cassette announcement. Case creation may be interrupted affecting your chargeback review and dispute classification queues. I've tagged you in the thread. Here's what to check.
ASR missed_brief: One brief, the people, opportunities and changes that matter to you.
ASR close_possibilities: These are just a few possibilities. What could your peer unlock for you?
ASR close: AI Peer, more room for your best work.
